&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain Event SLO&#39;s with AV Manager and collaborate on documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot issues as they arise in our All Hands space and conference rooms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Perform routine conference room sweeps to ensure readiness, cleanliness, and functionality of AV systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Assist in provisioning and configuring new hardware (cameras, microphones, conferencing devices) for office builds and upgrades&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain an organized inventory of AV equipment and recommend improvements to workflows, documentation, and processes&lt;/li&gt;
