&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong troubleshooting skills with the ability to stay calm and solution-oriented during live events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Excellent customer service and communication skills, with a collaborative mindset and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
