&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A portfolio that shows strong visual point-of-view carried through to finished execution, across mediums, with examples of styleframes, storyboards, and concepting; spec work with fake brands or products is welcome&lt;/li&gt;
