&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to create basic animations or motion tests independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Interest in researching and experimenting with new tools, workflows, and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working on product launch films, explainer videos, or product walkthroughs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to translate strategic complexity and feature detail into a story worth telling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A genuine understanding of and connection to Figma&#39;s values and mission — someone who is curious about the product and passionate about understanding it&lt;/li&gt;
