&lt;li&gt;Build and run the growth engine that turns attention into users and revenue across the full funnel, measured and accountable dollar for dollar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and lead a small, senior, high-output marketing team, while drawing on Figma’s scale, channels, and talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set marketing strategy and execute against it directly — moving fast, making bets, and measuring relentlessly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product, sales, and design teams, and with Figma’s broader marketing organization, to bring focus and ambition to a fast-moving market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deploy significant marketing budgets, tying every investment and tradeoff to measurable, ROI-positive impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an executive marketing leader who has built brand and driven growth at a high-growth software, SaaS, or consumer-tech company&lt;/li&gt;
