&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling and creative instincts, paired with the discipline to tie every investment to measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning and deploying significant marketing budgets, with demonstrated ROI-positive brand awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deeply data- and performance-driven approach, setting and managing against metrics across brand and full-funnel growth&lt;/li&gt;
