&lt;li&gt;Recruit, mentor, and develop the AMER Solutions Consulting leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage customer feedback and outcomes to collaborate with Product and Engineering to shape product improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in regional industry events/organizations as a thought leader&lt;/li&gt;
