&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage full-cycle recruiting processes for our business organizations, in particular, go to market functions like sales &amp;amp; marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leaders to develop top of funnel strategies for key roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and build healthy, representative pipelines to engage passive talent including: cold outreach, events, and content production while also effectively handling inbound applications and referrals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data to inform your hiring strategy and articulate these insights to executives in order to influence and drive positive change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, conceptualize and drive business improvement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-cycle in house recruiting experience in a high growth business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with senior executives on high volume searches in go to market organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of the SaaS / scaling tech landscape in APAC, particularly Singapore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced sourcing and passive engagement skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build a talent strategy alongside your hiring managers, while delivering an exceptional candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
