&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools to accelerate forecasting, reporting, and pipeline analysis—improving speed and accuracy of insights for leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI adoption within the regional Sales team through best practices, workflows, and enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with sales leaders across APAC subregions, navigating diverse markets, cultures, and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage regional operating activities, including quota/crediting decisions and escalations, to deliver actionable insights for Sales and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support forecasting meetings by presenting trends, risks, and opportunities to Sales Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend org design, headcount, book of business carving, and quota decisions across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Regional MBR/QBR reviews, analyzing funnel trends and KPIs and driving follow-up actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own performance dashboards, reports, and data-quality standards, keeping sales systems clean and trusted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of sales operations experience, ideally in a fast-growing environment, with deep SaaS knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to use AI to improve the speed, accuracy, and scale of sales ops work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting sales teams across multiple markets/regions with strong cross-cultural, cross-timezone flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical/technical skills, with proven expertise in Salesforce, BI tools, and building sophisticated spreadsheets, models, and exec presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative style and excellent communication skills, able to translate analysis into clear insights and deliver succinct presentations to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
