&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience writing clean code in at least one general-purpose language (e.g. C++, JavaScript, Python, Java, etc.), with a solid grasp of core CS concepts like data structures and algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience solving technical problems through school, work, or personal projects&lt;/li&gt;
