&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead strategic security programs from planning through execution, coordinating priorities, dependencies, risks, and accountability across security and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with teams across Figma to identify and address security risks, align stakeholders, and translate security priorities into practical guidance and action plans&lt;/li&gt;
